flowchart LR
    A[FinDER question] --> B[Identify issuer, metric, period, basis]
    B --> C[Read authorization and category capabilities]
    C --> D{Can one authorized view
    fill every required field?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Retrieve from one category graph]
    D -->|No| F[Select smallest authorized agent team]
    C --> G{Comparable claims conflict?}
    G -->|Yes| F
    G -->|No| D
    E --> H[Structured evidence]
    F --> I[Retrieve fixed evidence budget
    from selected views]
    I --> H
    H --> J{Evidence complete and safe?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Supervisor answer with source traces]
    J -->|No| L[Abstain or report unresolved conflict]

    classDef source fill:#ffffff,stroke:#4C78A8,stroke-width:2px
    classDef decision fill:#ffffff,stroke:#F58518,stroke-width:2px
    classDef evidence fill:#ffffff,stroke:#54A24B,stroke-width:2px
    classDef answer fill:#ffffff,stroke:#79706E,stroke-width:2px
    class A,B source
    class C,D,G,J decision
    class E,F,H,I evidence
    class K,L answer
